    ],
    "text": "DECLARING THE HOLY LAND OWNED BY THE THELWATTA PURANA THOTAGAMURATHPATH RAJAMAHA VIHARAYA AS A SACRED LAND PARALLEL TO THE NATIONAL VESAKFESTIVAL 2019",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.37,
      447.61,
      539.97,
      518.68
    ],
    "text": "ACCORDING to the communication made by His Excellency the President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of SriLanka in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 2103/33 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, dated Friday December28th 2018, and according to the subject of planning and developing the sacred places empowered, I, Gamini JayawickramaPerera as the Minister of Buddha Sasana and Wayamba Development declare that the Land area definitely described in theschedule herein is a sacred area forever and declare that as the \u201cThelwatta Purana Totagamu Rathpath RajamahaviharaPooja Holy Land\u2019\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
